</span></li>
<li id="bib.bib14" class="ltx_bibitem ltx_bib_article"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_bib_author-year ltx_role_refnum ltx_tag_bibitem">Yu <span class="ltx_text ltx_bib_etal">et al.</span> (2023)</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock"><span class="ltx_text ltx_bib_author">L. Yu <span class="ltx_text ltx_bib_etal">et al.</span></span>
</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock"><span class="ltx_text ltx_bib_title">Language model beats diffusion–tokenizer is key to visual generation</span>.
</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock"><span class="ltx_text ltx_bib_journal">arXiv preprint arXiv:2310.05737</span>.
</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock ltx_bib_cited">Cited by: <a href="#S1.p1.2" title="1 Introduction ‣ SOM-VQ: Topology-Aware Tokenization for Interactive Generative Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">§1</span></a>.
</span></li>
<li id="bib.bib22" class="ltx_bibitem ltx_bib_article"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_bib_author-year ltx_role_refnum ltx_tag_bibitem">Zeghidour <span class="ltx_text ltx_bib_etal">et al.</span> (2021)</span>
