<div id="A1.SSx5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SSx5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Note: This algorithm describes Phase 2 (joint training). Phase 1 consists of 10 epochs of pure SOM updates with annealed bandwidth to establish initial topology before encoder training begins.</p>
